{title: Mountain Trails}
{lyricist: Sergio Rykov}
{composer: Sergio Rykov}

{start_of_verse}
Mountains, trails, the same old notes,
Step by step you go,
Rustling wind, a glance ahead
To the new bends of the road
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Running off to nowhere, clouds are running after us,
And snow - a solid wall
Step - breathe, step - breathe, there's no path and no two roads,
And you - you follow me
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse}
I am free just like a bird
On the mountain ridge.
The wind echoes, whispers softly,
Calling me afar again.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Running off to nowhere, clouds are running after us,
And snow - a solid wall
{end_of_chorus}
